# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mobile build environment (used by: npm run build:mobile)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# IMPORTANT: Replace the IP below with your server's actual address.
#
#  ✅ PRODUCTION (Render.com backend) ← USE THIS:
#    After deploying to Render, your URL will look like:
#    https://ep-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
#    APK built with this URL works everywhere (home, 4G, office)
#
#  🏠 Local Wi-Fi testing only (temporary):
#    Set:  VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.x.x/api/v1
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⬇ Replace with your actual Render backend URL:
VITE_API_URL=https://ep-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
